WEBVTT

00:01.170 --> 00:03.250
<b>New Year</b>

00:03.290 --> 00:05.750
<b>New Year Temple Visit</b>

00:03.290 --> 00:05.750
<b>Praise Fudo Myoo</b>

00:05.830 --> 00:06.540
Sure are lots of people this year.

00:06.540 --> 00:07.540
A new year, a new first temple visit.
Sure are lots of people this year.<b></b>

00:07.540 --> 00:08.670
A new year, a new first temple visit.
Yeah.<b></b>

00:08.670 --> 00:09.580
A new year, a new first temple visit.

00:10.250 --> 00:11.580
With my family...

00:12.790 --> 00:17.040
I'm supposed to meet up with Yamada
to do the same thing in half an hour.

00:17.580 --> 00:19.250
The plan is to make up some excuse,

00:19.250 --> 00:23.000
stay behind as my family leaves,
and meet up with her.

00:23.380 --> 00:25.920
It's the perfect schedule.

00:26.380 --> 00:29.040
Oh, Kyo-chan, isn't that her?

00:29.290 --> 00:30.960
That's Yamada, isn't it?

00:33.630 --> 00:37.250
W-why! Are! You! Always! Early?!

00:37.380 --> 00:39.880
What? No way, where?

00:39.880 --> 00:40.460
Right there.

00:40.460 --> 00:44.210
Wow, it is her! The real Yamada.

00:44.460 --> 00:45.710
She's huge, huh?

00:45.710 --> 00:47.330
She tends to leave that impression.

00:47.460 --> 00:49.540
Not quite what I expected.

00:49.540 --> 00:50.830
Quit staring.

00:50.830 --> 00:53.920
Y'know, I forgot to ask something important.

00:53.920 --> 00:56.330
Does she have a boyfriend?

00:56.500 --> 00:58.210
Dunno. Why?

00:58.210 --> 00:59.250
I mean...

00:59.380 --> 01:01.000
She's all dressed up.

01:01.170 --> 01:03.500
She keeps checking her mirror.

01:03.580 --> 01:05.210
Working on her smile.

01:05.710 --> 01:08.960
She's clearly waiting for someone she likes.

01:09.080 --> 01:11.170
Y-yeah, right...

01:11.460 --> 01:15.880
Oh, right, yeah. Must just be imagining things.

01:15.880 --> 01:17.420
Go say hi or something.

01:17.420 --> 01:19.000
I-I'll pass...

01:19.500 --> 01:23.000
She just wants to stand by and watch.

01:23.420 --> 01:24.960
Go on.

01:24.960 --> 01:26.380
I said, I don't wanna.

01:36.580 --> 01:39.040
Stop.. I said, no...

01:41.130 --> 01:43.380
Oh, Yamada!

01:43.580 --> 01:45.750
Happy New Year.

01:45.750 --> 01:47.170
Hmm? Who's she?

01:47.170 --> 01:49.750
Oh, she's in Kyo-chan's class-

01:49.750 --> 01:51.790
I'm Anna Yamada.

01:54.380 --> 01:55.540
Hey...

01:55.540 --> 01:56.580
Don't be weird!

03:26.880 --> 03:28.790
<b>New Year Temple Visit</b>

03:28.580 --> 03:30.630
Whew, wasn't ready for that...

03:30.790 --> 03:34.250
I hope I'm not as weird as that all the time...

03:34.710 --> 03:36.170
Forget that, though.

03:36.380 --> 03:39.920
This isn't exactly how I thought this would go down.

03:39.920 --> 03:41.500
You're here alone, then?

03:41.500 --> 03:44.500
I am, so I'm glad you don't mind me joining.

03:48.420 --> 03:50.630
Way to double-book for this.

03:50.880 --> 03:52.330
L-like I had a choice.

03:55.540 --> 03:57.290
This is so awkward...

04:00.880 --> 04:03.250
Okay, we'll be waiting over here.

04:05.540 --> 04:06.500
Oh...

04:07.420 --> 04:09.080
You can't bring your hands together.

04:09.080 --> 04:10.170
It's fine.

04:10.420 --> 04:12.080
It's the thought that counts.

04:12.380 --> 04:13.630
Hmm...

04:18.380 --> 04:22.790
May our wishes come true.

04:27.250 --> 04:30.210
<b>New Year Temple Visit</b>

04:33.130 --> 04:34.710
What did you wish for?

04:34.710 --> 04:35.960
I didn't.

04:36.580 --> 04:39.290
I just wished for things to stay the same.

04:39.670 --> 04:40.790
Really?

04:41.210 --> 04:43.210
Nothing you want to change?

04:47.540 --> 04:50.670
All right, I'm headed the other way, so...

04:50.670 --> 04:51.580
That so?

04:51.580 --> 04:54.080
I hope you and Kyo-chan stay good friends this year.

04:54.080 --> 04:54.960
Cut it out.

04:55.080 --> 04:57.330
Sorry for intruding.

05:01.170 --> 05:03.420
Okay, just a little longer, and we meet back up...

05:03.420 --> 05:04.540
Hey!

05:04.830 --> 05:07.000
Talk about super mature!

05:07.000 --> 05:10.630
Even a budding socialite like me could hardly keep up.

05:10.630 --> 05:11.710
Gimme a break.

05:12.330 --> 05:16.330
Yamada did have a sort of grown-up
look to her today, though.

05:18.880 --> 05:24.330
<b>Praise Fudo Myoo</b>

05:19.670 --> 05:21.830
I'm starving.

05:22.630 --> 05:24.000
Want to drop by the usual udon place?

05:24.000 --> 05:24.790
Sure.

05:24.790 --> 05:26.670
Oh, I think I'll-

05:26.670 --> 05:29.000
Sorry, count us out.

05:31.540 --> 05:34.210
I wanna make a better first impression.

05:34.210 --> 05:35.580
No, come on-

05:35.750 --> 05:38.080
<b>Best Around</b>

05:35.750 --> 05:38.080
<b>Fried Chicken</b>

05:38.170 --> 05:39.830
This really the right way?

05:39.830 --> 05:40.960
I think so...

05:44.750 --> 05:45.580
Yamada.

05:46.330 --> 05:47.130
Oh!

05:50.040 --> 05:52.460
I boff oo some foo.

05:59.420 --> 06:01.670
Hey, Yamada?

06:01.670 --> 06:02.580
Yeff?

06:02.710 --> 06:04.630
Want to come over our place?

06:05.710 --> 06:06.630
What?!

06:09.830 --> 06:10.670
Yes!

06:10.670 --> 06:11.830
Why?!

06:15.210 --> 06:18.250
I DEFINITELY wasn't expecting this...

06:19.420 --> 06:20.830
Why'd you invite her over?

06:20.830 --> 06:23.920
I-I guess I just found her charming?

06:23.920 --> 06:25.420
What were you thinking?

06:26.540 --> 06:29.000
S-sorry to intrude all of a sudden.

06:29.000 --> 06:31.880
It's fine. I'm the one who invited you.

06:31.880 --> 06:35.880
Didn't expect to find you still
there snacking away, though.

06:36.290 --> 06:39.130
Were you waiting for somebody?

06:39.130 --> 06:41.290
What? Oh, not really.

06:41.290 --> 06:45.290
Right, yeah, you'd have to stay there if you were...

06:46.500 --> 06:48.000
"I boff oo some foo..."

06:50.000 --> 06:53.750
"I bought you some, too"?

06:56.250 --> 06:57.540
You really got a chance, here!

06:57.540 --> 06:58.580
Cut it out.

07:01.500 --> 07:02.710
<b>Happy New Year</b>

07:02.790 --> 07:04.380
T-thanks for having me.

07:04.380 --> 07:05.670
Make yourself at home.

07:11.830 --> 07:12.790
Shoot!

07:13.000 --> 07:18.130
I told my sister I bought that
Akita dog strap to match hers.

07:19.290 --> 07:21.250
If she sees that...

07:25.920 --> 07:28.080
Moving a little fast, I'd say!

07:28.080 --> 07:29.920
No! I... This is!

07:30.500 --> 07:31.880
You two are already that close?

07:31.880 --> 07:32.670
No!

07:32.670 --> 07:34.250
Well, what, then?

07:35.830 --> 07:36.830
Did she see it?!

07:41.630 --> 07:42.670
You're really in junior high?

07:42.670 --> 07:43.290
Yeah.

07:43.290 --> 07:44.330
Cut it out.

07:44.580 --> 07:46.500
<b>Temple visit</b>

07:44.580 --> 07:46.500
<b>First day of work</b>

07:44.580 --> 07:46.500
<b>Opening Ceremony</b>

07:46.750 --> 07:48.330
Here, have some new New Year's soup.

07:48.330 --> 07:51.540
Wow, did you make this?

07:51.540 --> 07:53.920
Nah. It's just leftover from this morning.

07:55.750 --> 07:57.210
Thank you.

08:05.420 --> 08:06.040
She's so c-

08:06.040 --> 08:07.710
You're so cute!

08:07.710 --> 08:10.040
Is she a speaker for my thoughts or something?

08:10.830 --> 08:13.580
Bet everyone tells you you're super cute, right?

08:14.170 --> 08:16.210
Yeff, they foo!

08:16.420 --> 08:17.580
Such confidence!

08:19.420 --> 08:21.080
Thanks for the soup.

08:21.290 --> 08:24.710
What do your friends call you, Yamada?

08:24.710 --> 08:25.330
Huh?

08:25.330 --> 08:28.130
Was just wondering what I should call you.

08:28.130 --> 08:31.460
Doesn't feel too friendly to use last names.

08:31.460 --> 08:32.540
You aren't friends.

08:32.790 --> 08:35.960
My friends call me... Dayama and stuff.

08:35.960 --> 08:37.040
Since when?

08:37.250 --> 08:39.750
What do you think I should call her?

08:39.750 --> 08:41.040
Like I know.

08:41.670 --> 08:43.210
Her first name or something?

08:43.330 --> 08:47.210
Yeah? What's her name, then?

08:47.210 --> 08:47.920
Huh?

08:48.710 --> 08:50.170
Yeah, what is it?

08:51.130 --> 08:52.750
A-An-

08:55.580 --> 08:57.960
An-na...

08:58.250 --> 09:00.040
Hey, back off!

09:00.210 --> 09:04.330
Oh, just me? It's fine that she's close?

09:04.330 --> 09:06.130
N-no, but...

09:07.000 --> 09:11.000
All right, I think it's about time
we break out the yearbooks!

09:11.000 --> 09:12.210
No one wants that!

09:13.580 --> 09:14.080
<b>Take Flight</b>

09:15.710 --> 09:17.460
Let's see...

09:18.170 --> 09:19.830
Here we go. Have at.

09:19.920 --> 09:21.380
<b>Kana Ichikawa</b>

09:20.080 --> 09:21.250
Wait, YOURS?

09:21.460 --> 09:25.330
Oh, do I have permission to get yours, then?

09:24.460 --> 09:26.170
<b>Take</b>

09:24.460 --> 09:26.170
<b>Flight</b>

09:26.250 --> 09:28.920
Hang on... Ah, here.

09:30.750 --> 09:33.420
P-pretty much the same as now, yeah?

09:30.830 --> 09:32.040
<b>Kyotaro Ichikawa</b>

09:33.420 --> 09:35.290
No, you're completely different.

09:35.290 --> 09:37.500
Look at that smug face.

09:41.830 --> 09:43.960
We have pictures from junior high, too.

09:44.000 --> 09:46.500
From the entrance ceremony...

09:44.000 --> 09:46.540
<b>Meguro Ward Daijuni Junior High</b>

09:44.000 --> 09:46.540
<b>Entrance Ceremony</b>

09:46.750 --> 09:49.000
Right next to the teacher as always.

09:49.250 --> 09:50.790
Enough already.

09:50.880 --> 09:52.710
What about from the school outdoor excursion?

09:53.290 --> 09:54.290
Ah...

09:56.250 --> 09:58.880
He... never went.

10:01.630 --> 10:02.630
Oh...

10:03.000 --> 10:04.880
T-that's definitely enough!

10:10.710 --> 10:15.290
Ack, I almost forgot. I made plans with my friends.

10:15.290 --> 10:15.830
What?

10:16.080 --> 10:17.330
Oh, I'll get going too, then...

10:17.330 --> 10:21.170
No, no, there's still more soup. Stay and relax.

10:21.170 --> 10:21.790
But...

10:21.790 --> 10:23.580
Is this Yamada's?

10:25.580 --> 10:26.460
Huh?

10:27.670 --> 10:29.920
Then is this one Kana's...?

10:29.920 --> 10:33.380
Hey, I don't mean this to sound overbearing, but...

10:33.880 --> 10:35.080
Thanks.

10:35.790 --> 10:39.130
For being friends with Kyo-chan.

10:42.080 --> 10:45.330
I'm just happy for him.

10:51.750 --> 10:53.290
H-hey.

10:55.250 --> 10:57.170
C-can I...

10:59.130 --> 11:01.960
Can I call you my "sis"?

11:03.830 --> 11:04.790
Wha?!

11:05.460 --> 11:11.880
O-only if I get to call you Anna-chan, too!

11:13.250 --> 11:15.330
Quit getting all weird again!

11:21.670 --> 11:23.080
Oh, do we...

11:23.630 --> 11:26.210
...have the same straps?

11:35.920 --> 11:42.250
We put soy sauce and mochi in ours too,
but this was so much better.

11:42.880 --> 11:45.290
You don't have to wash the dishes.

11:45.290 --> 11:47.750
It's fine, I'm almost finished anyway.

11:48.080 --> 11:51.750
What now? We're home alone together...

11:52.580 --> 11:54.830
Better put those albums away, first...

11:57.500 --> 11:59.000
Hey now. Hey now!

11:59.000 --> 12:00.920
Why is she following me?

12:01.080 --> 12:04.880
Your sister is so cute and so friendly, though.

12:05.330 --> 12:09.380
She's always going through my stuff...

12:12.380 --> 12:13.380
You know...

12:13.630 --> 12:14.420
I've actually seen this before.

12:14.420 --> 12:15.830
She's on my bed!
I've actually seen this before.<b></b>

12:16.130 --> 12:17.920
Here you are again.

12:17.920 --> 12:18.790
Yeah...

12:18.960 --> 12:20.670
But how'd you know?

12:20.880 --> 12:24.330
Oh, well, you and Chii went to the same school, right?

12:24.630 --> 12:26.630
She showed me hers a while back.

12:27.750 --> 12:31.080
I wasn't trying to find you or anything, though...

12:31.080 --> 12:32.420
Hmm...

12:32.500 --> 12:34.290
Wait, yesterday I...

12:35.080 --> 12:37.460
Has she noticed? Does it smell?

12:37.960 --> 12:39.670
Empty. Thank goodness...

12:39.830 --> 12:41.580
Hey, what about...

12:50.210 --> 12:51.960
Were you close with these two?

12:51.960 --> 12:54.500
Oh, Kinoshita and Takano...

12:54.960 --> 12:57.540
We were in the same cram school and stuff,
so we hung out a lot.

12:57.790 --> 12:58.960
What about now?

13:00.380 --> 13:03.170
They both went to private schools.

13:03.830 --> 13:06.290
Private schools, huh...

13:07.830 --> 13:09.130
And you...

13:12.130 --> 13:13.130
Never mind.

13:14.630 --> 13:16.500
What are all these?

13:16.670 --> 13:23.250
Oh, prizes from essay contests, poster competitions,
local science fairs and stuff.

13:23.380 --> 13:24.630
Wow!

13:25.130 --> 13:27.290
All from my glory days...

13:27.290 --> 13:30.290
Oh wow, a national prize, too...

13:30.460 --> 13:35.580
"Bizarre Crime Files -Murders-"

13:35.880 --> 13:39.630
<b>Bizarre Crime Files -Murders-</b>

13:36.960 --> 13:39.380
"Crimes that shook the world..."

13:39.710 --> 13:45.500
T-that's about the minds of murderers and stuff...

13:48.710 --> 13:49.790
Wow!

13:50.080 --> 13:54.040
I know this stuff! It's like, psychology, right?

13:54.330 --> 13:55.210
Maybe...

13:55.210 --> 13:56.250
Definitely.

13:56.670 --> 13:57.920
I dunno...

14:01.580 --> 14:03.830
Can you read my mind, then?

14:06.380 --> 14:10.380
N-no... You're not a murderer.

14:11.380 --> 14:12.790
You so sure?

14:12.790 --> 14:15.540
I could lead a whole secret life.

14:15.960 --> 14:17.170
Give it a try.

14:23.040 --> 14:23.670
Wait!

14:52.170 --> 14:54.960
Sorry for poking through your stuff...

14:55.630 --> 14:56.920
I'm done for...

15:04.170 --> 15:05.000
Huh?

15:05.420 --> 15:06.420
What?

15:16.460 --> 15:22.500
Next time, I'll show you my yearbook.

15:23.790 --> 15:24.670
Bye, then.

15:28.130 --> 15:32.330
Does that mean... Did she just invite me over...?

15:33.540 --> 15:35.500
No. No way.

15:36.000 --> 15:37.750
<b>I</b>

15:40.790 --> 15:42.880
<b>Accepted Applicants</b>

15:43.380 --> 15:44.960
<b>Applicant Information</b>

15:43.380 --> 15:44.960
<b>Applicant No.</b>

15:43.380 --> 15:44.960
<b>Name                                  Kyotaro Ichikawa</b>

15:43.380 --> 15:44.960
<b>Date of Birth                                    Feb 3</b>

15:52.830 --> 15:54.880
How about we go out for some udon?

15:55.500 --> 15:57.460
<b>Graduation</b>

15:57.830 --> 16:00.040
Let's hang out even after we start junior high.

16:00.040 --> 16:01.420
I'll keep in touch.

16:02.540 --> 16:03.500
Yeah...

16:05.170 --> 16:05.960
Ichikawa!

16:06.500 --> 16:09.540
Hey Ichikawa, wanna join our group for-

16:09.540 --> 16:10.460
Yikes!

16:10.500 --> 16:12.080
<b>Bizarre Crime Files -Murders-</b>

16:19.750 --> 16:23.960
Dragging out those old yearbooks
is messing with my dreams...

16:27.330 --> 16:28.750
You never learn.

16:28.750 --> 16:30.830
That stuff might scare people off again.

16:31.170 --> 16:33.460
Let it. It's what I'm into.

16:34.000 --> 16:35.790
Where's your shirt?

16:36.210 --> 16:38.290
I'm a mirror of your heart...

16:38.750 --> 16:43.330
Maybe you really want to show it all.
Everything inside.

16:51.460 --> 16:52.670
Hup.

16:53.920 --> 16:56.210
Haha, listen to him hop in.

16:56.210 --> 16:57.790
What are you doing in here?

16:57.880 --> 16:59.630
Getting a lift to the station.

17:02.580 --> 17:04.000
You seem to be in a good mood.

17:04.000 --> 17:05.080
What?

17:12.670 --> 17:13.330
Boo!

17:14.130 --> 17:15.210
Did I spook you?

17:15.210 --> 17:17.170
Don't hide behind cars like that.

17:17.170 --> 17:19.080
You rolled up like some big hot-shot.

17:19.250 --> 17:20.330
Hello, Yamada.

17:20.330 --> 17:22.130
Oh, good morning.

17:22.130 --> 17:27.210
This is his first day back after getting hurt,
look after him for us, okay?

17:27.380 --> 17:28.000
Of course!

17:28.000 --> 17:29.420
What's going on, here?

17:34.630 --> 17:36.330
W-what?

17:37.630 --> 17:39.500
Where's Akita Kenjiro?

17:39.500 --> 17:40.630
Who's Kenjiro?

17:40.710 --> 17:45.080
If mine is named Kentaro,
yours has to be Kenjiro.

17:45.080 --> 17:47.040
Who says you get to name it?

17:48.210 --> 17:50.630
He's right here, though...

17:52.460 --> 17:53.750
You aren't gonna strap it on?

17:54.000 --> 17:56.080
Not one-handed...

17:56.460 --> 17:57.380
Oh, then...

17:58.290 --> 18:01.080
N-no. It's fine...

18:01.920 --> 18:02.500
There!

18:02.500 --> 18:04.170
Don't "there" me.

18:04.460 --> 18:06.880
It might get dirty, though...

18:06.880 --> 18:10.290
True, better put it on the next button down.

18:12.080 --> 18:13.790
We better get moving.

18:14.670 --> 18:16.830
Bet everyone's inside already.

18:29.040 --> 18:30.460
<b>Want</b>

18:39.210 --> 18:41.130
<b>To Be Seen</b>

18:42.830 --> 18:44.880
It's strange.

18:45.920 --> 18:47.040
What is?

18:48.250 --> 18:51.880
Back in year one,
I never wanted to come to school.

18:52.130 --> 18:53.710
I stayed home a lot.

18:54.540 --> 18:57.040
Even lied my way out of events.

19:02.790 --> 19:03.830
But...

19:04.540 --> 19:07.960
These days, I don't hate it anymore.

19:08.830 --> 19:11.460
A-and that's...

19:11.920 --> 19:13.330
You know...

19:14.250 --> 19:20.170
Probably thanks... to you...

19:20.960 --> 19:24.420
O-only person you should thank is you.

19:24.710 --> 19:32.420
If you didn't come to school in the first place,
you'd never have talked with me or anyone else, right?

19:33.380 --> 19:34.710
So, yeah.

19:40.830 --> 19:41.670
Here.

19:42.210 --> 19:45.830
This armor is what let me come to school.

19:47.040 --> 19:50.500
I always told myself this was why I didn't fit in..

19:54.330 --> 19:55.250
Thanks.

20:08.250 --> 20:09.790
There, there.

20:11.210 --> 20:12.630
I guess.

20:14.040 --> 20:17.750
I just...

20:20.290 --> 20:22.540
What I wanted to say all this time was...

20:25.130 --> 20:26.210
Thanks.

20:39.500 --> 20:41.830
Yikes, we're gonna be late!

20:43.830 --> 20:45.960
Hey. G'morning.

20:52.210 --> 20:53.960
Wait, did you two do it?

20:54.080 --> 20:54.710
What?!

20:54.710 --> 20:58.330
Looks to me like you did! Yikes!

20:58.330 --> 20:59.000
Hey!

21:01.630 --> 21:02.540
Here.

21:02.000 --> 21:03.250
<b>Shrimp Snack</b>

21:08.670 --> 21:09.540
Just kidding.

21:17.290 --> 21:18.290
Thanks.

21:25.250 --> 21:27.330
<b>I Wanted to Be Seen</b>
